安装路径：/Users/ruoke/Documents/devTools/apache-jmeter-5.6.3/bin&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Nginx</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/nginx/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/nginx/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="cli">CLI
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#cli">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>nginx -V 查看 Nginx配置文件的位置：/opt/homebrew/etc/nginx/nginx.conf&lt;/p>
&lt;p>nginx命令启动master进程，nginx分为master进程和worker进程。
master进程负责读取配置文件、管理worker进程；worker进程实际处理HTTP请求。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Maven</title><link>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/maven/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ruokezhang.github.io/post/maven/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="basic">Basic
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#basic">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="java-version">Java Version
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#java-version">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>ruoke@Ruokes-MacBook-Pro ~ % mvn -v
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Apache Maven 3.9.6 &lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">(&lt;/span>bc0240f3c744dd6b6ec2920b3cd08dcc295161ae&lt;span style="color:#04a5e5;font-weight:bold">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Maven home: /Users/ruoke/Documents/devTools/apache-maven-3.9.6
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>Java version: 21.0.3, vendor: Oracle Corporation, runtime: /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/jdk-21.jdk/Contents/Home
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这个 Java 版本是 Maven 本身运行时使用的 Java 版本&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8839ef">&amp;lt;properties&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">&amp;lt;java.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span>1.8&lt;span style="color:#8839ef">&amp;lt;/java.version&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>&lt;span style="color:#8839ef">&amp;lt;/properties&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>我项目里的 pom指定该项目的Java编译时版本，会影响maven-compiler-plugin去找哪个版本的JDK；但这里并不指定该项目的运行时版本。
可以在Project Structure里面规定哪个版本JDK用来编译文件&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>